00:00:45.125 --> 00:00:47.430
WESLEY: We're going to
begin with the module 1 app,

00:00:47.430 --> 00:00:49.830
the one we just migrated
from webapp 2 to Flask,

00:00:49.830 --> 00:00:52.290
and add use of App
Engine Memcache to it.

00:00:52.290 --> 00:00:54.750
Here's a link to that
module 1 codelab and video

00:00:54.750 --> 00:00:56.915
so you can review
it, if necessary.

00:00:56.915 --> 00:00:58.660
MARTIN: That sounds good, Wes.

00:00:58.660 --> 00:01:01.120
Now both of those
