to get them to the latest App

00:04:19.239 --> 00:04:21.260
Engine runtimes.

00:04:21.260 --> 00:04:25.430
Onscreen now are the Python
2 and 3 versions of the app.

00:04:25.430 --> 00:04:28.100
The differences you see are
what Python 2 developers

00:04:28.100 --> 00:04:30.470
have to do to port
their apps to Python 3.

00:04:30.470 --> 00:04:33.710
This is an addition to any
other Python 2-to-3 migration

00:04:33.710 --> 00:04:36.000
