00:04:40.630 --> 00:04:43.230
So what you see is how to
access App Engine bundled

00:04:43.230 --> 00:04:44.970
services in Python 3.

00:04:44.970 --> 00:04:47.520
More details can be found
in the Docs link below,

00:04:47.520 --> 00:04:50.640
as well as how to access
these services from Java 11,

00:04:50.640 --> 00:04:53.340
Go 1.12 and newer, and PHP 7.

